I am trying to implement an IWDG in my program, which will save the value of the specified register to EEPROM before resetting. <br>
But I found that my program is not working. <br>
I politely request your developers to provide a simple example of IWDG using HAL_SWDG_Registercallbacks. <br>
Many thanks. :-)
```c
